<title>DENMARK: FORECAST - Danish unemployment at 8.9 pct end-1996.</title>
<headline>FORECAST - Danish unemployment at 8.9 pct end-1996.</headline>
<dateline>COPENHAGEN 1996-10-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Denmark's Economy Ministry said on Monday that it expected unemployment of 8.9 percent of the workforce at end-1996, with the jobless total at end-1997 at 8.4 percent.</p>
<p>Danish unemployment averaged 10.3 percent in 1995 and stood at 9.1 percent in July 1996.</p>
<p>The figures in the ministry's latest economic survey, compared with a forecast for 1996 of 9.0 percent and 8.6 percent for 1997 in its last survey in August.</p>
<p>--Chris Follett, Copenhagen newsroom +45-33969652</p>
